   5:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****   * @version V1.8.0
   6:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****   * @date    04-November-2016
   7:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****   * @brief   This file provides firmware functions to manage the following 
   8:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****   *          functionalities of the LTDC controller (LTDC) peripheral:
   9:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****   *           + Initialization and configuration
  10:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****   *           + Interrupts and flags management
  11:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****   *           
  12:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****   *  @verbatim
  13:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****   
  14:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****  ===============================================================================
  15:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****                       ##### How to use this driver #####
  16:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****  ===============================================================================
  17:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****     [..]
  18:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****         (#) Enable LTDC clock using 
  19:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****             RCC_APB2PeriphResetCmd(RCC_APB2Periph_LTDC, ENABLE) function.
  20:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****         (#) Configures LTDC
  21:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****           (++) Configure the required Pixel clock following the panel datasheet
  22:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****           (++) Configure the Synchronous timings: VSYNC, HSYNC, Vertical and 
  23:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****               Horizontal back proch, active data area and the front proch 
  24:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****               timings 
  25:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****           (++) Configure the synchronous signals and clock polarity in the 
  26:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****               LTDC_GCR register
  27:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****         (#) Configures Layer1/2 parameters
  28:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****           (++) The Layer window horizontal and vertical position in the LTDC_LxWHPCR and 
  29:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****                LTDC_WVPCR registers. The layer window must be in the active data area.
  30:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****           (++) The pixel input format in the LTDC_LxPFCR register
ARM GAS  /tmp/cciVGXQG.s 			page 2


  31:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****           (++) The color frame buffer start address in the LTDC_LxCFBAR register
  32:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****           (++) The line length and pitch of the color frame buffer in the 
  33:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****                LTDC_LxCFBLR register
  34:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****           (++) The number of lines of the color frame buffer in 
  35:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****                the LTDC_LxCFBLNR register
  36:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****           (++) if needed, load the CLUT with the RGB values and the address 
  37:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****                in the LTDC_LxCLUTWR register
  38:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****           (++) If needed, configure the default color and the blending factors 
  39:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****                respectively in the LTDC_LxDCCR and LTDC_LxBFCR registers 
  40:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c **** 
  41:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****           (++) If needed, Dithering and color keying can be enabled respectively 
  42:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****                in the LTDC_GCR and LTDC_LxCKCR registers. It can be also enabled 
  43:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****                on the fly.    
  44:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****         (#) Enable Layer1/2 and if needed the CLUT in the LTDC_LxCR register 
  45:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****   
  46:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****         (#) Reload the shadow registers to active register through 
  47:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****             the LTDC_SRCR register.
  48:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****           -@- All layer parameters can be modified on the fly except the CLUT. 
  49:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****               The new configuration has to be either reloaded immediately 
  50:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****               or during vertical blanking period by configuring the LTDC_SRCR register.
  51:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****         (#) Call the LTDC_Cmd() to enable the LTDC controller.
  52:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c **** 
  53:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****     @endverbatim
  54:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****   
  55:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_ltdc.c ****   ******************************************************************************
